flowchart LR
    A[Receive versioned governance packet] --> B{Packet valid and complete?}
    B -- No --> X[Return through controlled correction path]
    B -- Yes --> C{Current committee, ToR, peer rules and delegation resolved?}
    C -- No --> Y[Block and create visible governance exception]
    C -- Yes --> D[Schedule consideration]
    D --> E{Quorum, relevant peer and conflict controls satisfied?}
    E -- No --> Z[Defer and record reason]
    E -- Yes --> F[Human committee deliberation]
    F --> G{Potentially adverse material or outcome?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Complete procedural fairness]
    G -- No --> I[Record human recommendation]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Route to current delegate]
    J --> K{Current authority and human decision confirmed?}
    K -- No --> Y
    K -- Yes --> L[Record separate delegated decision]
    L --> M[Human-reviewed communication]
    M --> N[Return immutable result references]
    N --> O[Create conditions, supervision and review actions]
    O --> P[Emit privacy-minimised process events]
    P --> Q[Finalise governance record]
    Q --> R[Downstream register and release control remains separate]

    classDef human fill:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    class F,H,I,J,L,M human;
